---
title: "Blog"
description: "Longer posts on what I'm building, learning, and thinking about."
date: 2026-11-01
image: /img/og/blog.jpeg
pagination:
  data: collections.posts
  size: 100
  reverse: true
  alias: blogPosts
---
{% set postsCount = collections.posts | length %}
<div class="archive-title-row">
	<h1>Blog</h1>
	<a class="archive-feed-icon-link" href="/feed/" title="RSS feed" aria-label="Open RSS feeds page">
		{% phicon "rss" %}
	</a>
</div>

<p>Longer posts on what I'm building, learning, and thinking about.</p>
<hr class="page-intro-divider" />

{% set postslist = blogPosts %}
{% set postslistCounter = postsCount - (pagination.pageNumber * pagination.size) %}
{% set noReverse = true %}
{% set showKindBadge = false %}
{% set showTags = true %}
{# list sits directly under the page h1, so titles are h2 (no level skip) #}
{% set postHeadingLevel = 2 %}
{% include "postslist.njk" %}

{% include "pagination.njk" %}
